{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And behold, until now you have not listened —</b> כה אמר ה׳ (thus said YHWH): כה in א\"ת ב\"ש (atbash) = לץ, and ב\"פ לץ (bet-peh, i.e. doubling) = לץ לץ, totaling ר\"ם (210). So many plagues struck Egypt — מ (40) — and at the sea ר (200), totaling ר\"ם (210). This is what was hinted to him: you will not listen until you are struck, as the numerical value of כה כה (25 + 25 = 50). n: The text appears corrupt. The gematria arithmetic as written does not yield 210 from לץ לץ (לץ = 130; doubled = 260), nor 50 from כה כה (which equals 50 only if taken once). The final citation is to Proverbs 19:25. The phrase 'וב״פ לץ' is obscure; read as bet-peh substitution yielding לץ, followed by a second לץ, following the pattern of the atbash statement."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:10.662556392Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}